{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "9373a381f68ddb0a4a5eb33e0ec1b1efe4534e37646dacbe4bb53d42169b7898",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0001",
      "text": "Missing Slippage Protection in `executeDeposit` Function Allows MEV Attacks and Unfair Exchange Rates",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 101,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0002",
      "text": "## Description",
      "start": 103,
      "end": 117,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0003",
      "text": "The `executeDeposit` function in the HypoVault contract lacks slippage protection, allowing users to receive fewer shares than expected for their deposited assets. This vulnerability stems from the two-phase deposit system where users have no control over the exchange rate determination.",
      "start": 119,
      "end": 407,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0004",
      "text": "**File:** `src/HypoVault.sol`",
      "start": 409,
      "end": 438,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0005",
      "text": "and the execute function:",
      "start": 442,
      "end": 467,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0006",
      "text": "**Related Function:** `fulfillDeposits`",
      "start": 471,
      "end": 510,
      "line": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0007",
      "text": "## Impact",
      "start": 514,
      "end": 523,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0008",
      "text": "MEV bots can sandwich the `fulfillDeposits()` call to manipulate the exchange rate. Users have **zero control** over when their deposits are fulfilled",
      "start": 525,
      "end": 675,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0009",
      "text": "- The exchange rate is determined entirely by the manager's timing of `fulfillDeposits()`",
      "start": 677,
      "end": 766,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0010",
      "text": "- Users may receive significantly fewer shares than expected due to:",
      "start": 767,
      "end": 835,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0011",
      "text": "- Market volatility between deposit request and fulfillment",
      "start": 838,
      "end": 897,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0012",
      "text": "- Manager's strategic timing of fulfillment",
      "start": 900,
      "end": 943,
      "line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0013",
      "text": "- NAV calculation manipulation",
      "start": 946,
      "end": 976,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0014",
      "text": "## Attack Scenarios",
      "start": 978,
      "end": 997,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0015",
      "text": "1. User calls `requestDeposit(1000 USDC)`",
      "start": 999,
      "end": 1040,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0016",
      "text": "2. MEV bot front-runs with large deposit to inflate NAV",
      "start": 1041,
      "end": 1096,
      "line": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0017",
      "text": "3. Manager calls `fulfillDeposits()` with inflated NAV",
      "start": 1097,
      "end": 1151,
      "line": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0018",
      "text": "4. User's `executeDeposit()` receives fewer shares due to inflated exchange rate",
      "start": 1152,
      "end": 1232,
      "line": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "e_9373a381f68d_0019",
      "text": "5. MEV bot back-runs with withdrawal to profit",
      "start": 1233,
      "end": 1279,
      "line": 31
    }
  ]
}
